-- Stormwind Vaults (map 35), five of its bosses: its C++ as rows -- EPIC10 tier 2.
-- Written by the trt repo's scripts/tier2/a16_stormwind_vaults.py from d6_world; stormwind_vaults_restore.sql puts
-- back what this replaces. R8: a person applies it, into the world database.
--
-- The C++ keeps its script names: mod-stormwind-vaults is the switch (AM1, handoff/manager-091).
-- Loaded, the C++ runs as before -- a script found by name comes first. Unloaded
-- (`module unload mod-stormwind-vaults`, which gives every creature standing a new AI at once),
-- the names find no script and the creatures run these rows (their ai_name).
--
-- Map 35 keeps instance_stormwind_vaults, Damian and Volkan (the core). The zone-wide says of the
-- C++ are plain says here; Tham's and Grarr's lines are Tham'Grarr's, as no row names a speaker;
-- the bosses no longer wait 2-4 s between spells as the C++ queues held them.

